-- Port XLA to FreeBSD/aarch64: replace the pip hub with a local stub, add a cpuinfo
-- FreeBSD arm64 backend, select the AArch64 LLVM native target, define
-- XLA_LLVM_AARCH64_AVAILABLE, and implement getauxval() with elf_aux_info().
-- XLA has no FreeBSD support upstream; applied to the xla override module.
